---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<BaseLayout title="页面不存在 · Prism AI 棱镜" description="你访问的页面不存在或已被移动。">
  <section class="not-found">
    <div class="nf-card glass-panel reveal">
      <p class="nf-code">404</p>
      <h1>这束光没有找到落点</h1>
      <p>你访问的页面不存在，可能链接已失效或内容被移动。</p>
      <div class="nf-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={base}>返回首页</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={base + 'prompts'}>浏览提示词库</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .not-found {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .nf-card {
    padding: 3.5rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .nf-code {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, #38bdf8, #0ea5e9);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }

  .nf-card h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .nf-card p {
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
  }

  .nf-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
</style>
